<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ja"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><link rel="stylesheet" href="{{.Assets}}/css/06c0f1263d868f78.css"><title>古平町観光協会</title><meta name="description" content="北海道古平町の観光情報サイト"><meta name="application-name" content="古平観光"><link rel="manifest" href="/meta/site.webmanifest"><meta name="generator" content="v0.dev"><meta property="og:title" content="古平町観光協会 | 熱く燃ゆる町"><meta property="og:description" content="北海道古平町の観光情報サイト。天狗の火渡りや新鮮な海産物、温泉、宿泊施設など、古平町の魅力的な観光スポットをご紹介します。"><meta property="og:url" content="https://furubira-kanko.com"><meta property="og:site_name" content="古平町観光協会"><meta property="og:locale" content="ja_JP"><meta property="og:image" content="https://furubira-kanko.com/meta/ogp.jpg"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="OGP Image"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:site" content="@furubira_enjoy"><meta name="twitter:title" content="古平町観光協会"><meta name="twitter:description" content="北海道古平町の観光情報サイト"><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://furubira-kanko.com/meta/ogp.jpg"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico?88dfb7f9683f6a4b" type="image/x-icon" sizes="48x48"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="icon" href="/favicon-96x96.png" type="image/png" sizes="96x96"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/meta/apple-touch-icon.png"><script>(()=>{let media=matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)");function apply(){try{let t=localStorage.getItem("theme")||"light";if(t==="system")t=media.matches?"dark":"light";let block;if(document.body){block=document.createElement("style");block.textContent="*,*::before,*::after{transition:none!important}";document.head.append(block)}document.documentElement.classList.remove("light","dark");document.documentElement.classList.add(t);document.documentElement.style.colorScheme=t==="dark"?"dark":"light";if(block){getComputedStyle(document.body);setTimeout(()=>block.remove(),1)}}catch{document.documentElement.classList.add("light");document.documentElement.style.colorScheme="light"}}apply();media.addEventListener("change",()=>{try{if(localStorage.getItem("theme")==="system")apply()}catch{}});window.addEventListener("storage",e=>{if(e.key==="theme")apply()})})()</script></head><body><div hidden=""></div><main class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50"><div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 space-y-8" data-news-editor=""><a href="/ja" class="underline">サイトへ</a><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">お知らせ編集</h1><section aria-labelledby="publication-flow-heading" class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="mb-6"><h2 id="publication-flow-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">お知らせを公開するまで</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">この画面での編集だけでは、公開サイトに反映されません。</p></div><ol role="list" class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-6"><li data-flow-step="1" class="relative flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4"><div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-sm font-bold text-white">1</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-pen-line h-5 w-5 text-slate-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 20h9"></path><path d="M16.376 3.622a1 1 0 0 1 3.002 3.002L7.368 18.635a2 2 0 0 1-.855.506l-2.872.838a.5.5 0 0 1-.62-.62l.838-2.872a2 2 0 0 1 .506-.854z"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">原稿を準備</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">入力してプレビューを確認。最後に「編集内容を一覧へ追加」を押します。</p><p class="mt-4 self-start rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold bg-white text-slate-600">サイト未反映</p><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down absolute -bottom-7 left-1/2 h-5 w-5 -translate-x-1/2 text-slate-400 lg:hidden" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right absolute -right-6 top-1/2 hidden h-5 w-5 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400 lg:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></li><li data-flow-step="2" class="relative flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4"><div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-sm font-bold text-white">2</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-down h-5 w-5 text-slate-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"></path><path d="M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><path d="M12 18v-6"></path><path d="m9 15 3 3 3-3"></path></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">ファイルを書き出す</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">タブを閉じる前に news.json を書き出します。新規・既存の全記事が入ります。</p><p class="mt-4 self-start rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold bg-white text-slate-600">サイト未反映</p><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down absolute -bottom-7 left-1/2 h-5 w-5 -translate-x-1/2 text-slate-400 lg:hidden" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right absolute -right-6 top-1/2 hidden h-5 w-5 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400 lg:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></li><li data-flow-step="3" class="relative flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4"><div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-sm font-bold text-white">3</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-git-pull-request h-5 w-5 text-slate-500" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"></circle><path d="M13 6h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7"></path><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="9" y2="21"></line></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">GitHubで確認依頼</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">新しいブランチで登録し、PR（変更の確認依頼）を作成。他の記事を消していないか差分を確認します。</p><p class="mt-4 self-start rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold bg-white text-slate-600">サイト未反映</p><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-down absolute -bottom-7 left-1/2 h-5 w-5 -translate-x-1/2 text-slate-400 lg:hidden" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right absolute -right-6 top-1/2 hidden h-5 w-5 -translate-y-1/2 text-slate-400 lg:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></li><li data-flow-step="4" class="relative flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4"><div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-sm font-bold text-white">4</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewbox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-earth h-5 w-5 text-slate-500" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54"></path><path d="M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17"></path><path d="M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">反映して公開確認</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700">確認後にマージ（変更を取り込む）。自動反映が完了したら、お知らせ一覧を確認します。</p><p class="mt-4 self-start rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-900">反映完了後に公開</p></li></ol><div class="mt-6 space-y-2 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600"><p><strong class="font-semibold text-slate-800">原稿はこのタブ内だけ。</strong>自動保存されません。閉じる前に一覧へ追加し、ファイルを書き出してください。</p><p>GitHubに登録した原稿は、サイト反映前のPR段階でも第三者が閲覧できます。</p><p>記事の「表示日」は掲載する日付です。予約公開の設定ではありません。</p></div></section><section class="space-y-3 rounded border p-4"><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for="import-news">最新版のnews.jsonを読み込む（任意・現在の一覧を置換）</label><input type="file" class="flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-base ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id="import-news" accept="application/json,.json"></section><form class="space-y-4 rounded border bg-white p-6"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">原稿を新規作成</h2><fieldset class="space-y-4"><div><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for="news-id">記事ID（必須・URLに使用）</label><input class="flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-base ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id="news-id" required="" maxlength="100" pattern="[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*" placeholder="2026-10-05-announcement" value=""></div><div><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for="title">タイトル（日本語・必須）</label><input class="flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-base ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id="title" required="" maxlength="200" value=""></div><div><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for="body">本文（日本語・必須）</label><textarea class="flex min-h-[80px] w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-base ring-offset-background placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id="body" required="" maxlength="20000" rows="10"></textarea><p class="text-sm text-gray-600">改行をそのまま表示します。HTMLは使用できません。</p></div><div><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for="published-on">表示日（必須・予約公開機能ではありません）</label><input type="date" class="flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-base ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id="published-on" required="" value="2026-10-25"></div><details><summary class="cursor-pointer">英語版（任意・未入力なら日本語を表示）</summary><div class="space-y-4 mt-4"><div><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for="title-en">Title</label><input class="flex h-10 w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-base ring-offset-background file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id="title-en" maxlength="200" value=""></div><div><label class="text-sm font-medium leading-none peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-70" for="body-en">Body</label><textarea class="flex min-h-[80px] w-full rounded-md border border-input bg-background px-3 py-2 text-base ring-offset-background placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm" id="body-en" rows="8" maxlength="20000"></textarea></div></div></details><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2" type="submit">編集内容を一覧へ追加</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2" type="button">プレビュー</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2" type="button">入力をクリア</button></div></fieldset></form><section class="space-y-4"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">書き出す記事一覧</h2><p>記事はありません。</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2">news.jsonを書き出す</button><a class="underline p-2" href="https://github.com/deervery/furubira-kanko-official/edit/main/content/news.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHubで登録（新しいブランチ・PR）</a></div></section></div></main><script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-S3TJ1KJS6X"></script><script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments)}gtag("js",new Date());gtag("config","G-S3TJ1KJS6X");</script><script type="module" src="{{.Assets}}/site.js"></script><script type="application/json" id="news-source">{{.EditorNews}}</script><script type="module" src="{{.Assets}}/news-editor.js"></script></body></html>